(text
"4.43V pre-regulator -> positive LDO; 250kHz inverter -> negative low-noise LDO.\nKeep CFLY/input/output capacitor loops at U404. Do not route switching nodes into the AFE.\nTPS723 EN is +3V3 (not +4V4_PRE); 10nF NR to GND. D402 bypasses reverse current at power-down.\n4.99k rail bleeders provide ~0.5mA load/discharge; they do not absorb arbitrary electrode faults."
