(text
"RESET/PWDN default LOW. After rails settle: PWDN HIGH, keep RESET LOW.\nWait >=tPOR AND VCAP1-AVSS >1.1V; use 10s initial bench delay.\n100uF / internal 9.8k means seconds, NOT 200ms. Verify with scope.\nThen RESET HIGH; wait >=18 CLK; SDATAC/configure/read back/start.\nNo automatic analog-rail/VCAP monitor is fitted; qualify timing on bench."
